{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/c02.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/c02.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "c02_bottom_02",
      "hash64": "8EB27C6306A38949",
      "text": "多亏了摩托蜥，\\n我们才能穿过烘烘沙漠啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "c02_bottom_03",
      "hash64": "8EB27B6306A38796",
      "text": "得用宝可梦洗澡澡\\n帮它把沙子清理干净才行呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "c02_bottom_08",
      "hash64": "8EB2826306A3937B",
      "text": "我希望它一直都是玛力露，\\n所以当它快要进化时……\\c\\n我就会用“Ｂ键取消进化！”\\n这个幸运咒语哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "c02_bottom_16",
      "hash64": "8EAF0E6306A09888",
      "text": "玻瓶市的对战场\\n相连着河川呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "c02_bottom_18",
      "hash64": "8EAF0C6306A09522",
      "text": "想到上面去的话，\\n就去升降机面前等着吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "c02_bottom_19",
      "hash64": "8EAF0D6306A096D5",
      "text": "再往前，水就很深了哦！\\n要是会用冲浪的话，就可以放心了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "c02_bottom_20",
      "hash64": "8EAB8E63069D8931",
      "text": "渍沁镇位于沙漠的另一边！\\n如果要去那里，可得做好充足准备哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "c02_bottom_31",
      "hash64": "8EA88963069B4ADB",
      "text": "有种带着硬币的小小的宝可梦！\\n我一靠近它，它就丢下硬币\\r\\n消失不见了！那是什么啊！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "c02_bottom_40",
      "hash64": "8EC0126306AF1287",
      "text": "我要不要买点什么带回去\\n给在家里等着的宝可梦呢～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "c02_bottom_41",
      "hash64": "8EC0116306AF10D4",
      "text": "我喜欢的食物\\n和宝可梦喜欢的食物\\r\\n好像不太一样，是为什么呢～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "c02_bottom_53",
      "hash64": "8EBC8B6306ABF74B",
      "text": "这座城镇的墙壁就像是瀑布耶！\\n可以用来练习攀瀑呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "c02_bottom_54",
      "hash64": "8EBC906306ABFFCA",
      "text": "我是从穴扎镇来的，\\n所以被这里的水量吓了一大跳！\\r\\n毕竟在那边，水是很珍贵的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "c02_bottom_60",
      "hash64": "8EB9866306A9B8F5",
      "text": "玛力露是水属性！\\n所以它果然是很喜欢水哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "c02_bottom_70",
      "hash64": "8EB6006306A69F6C",
      "text": "当我拿不定主意该吃什么时，\\n就会不知不觉地到来来来轩这儿呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "c02_center_01",
      "hash64": "8BE972D3CE7158DA",
      "text": "这里是让坐骑宝可梦\\n稍微休息的地方。\\c\\n骑着它们东奔西跑之后，\\n也得对它们好好表示感谢才行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "c02_center_02",
      "hash64": "8BE971D3CE715727",
      "text": "玻瓶市是座水都！\\n你看了就知道了～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "c02_center_14",
      "hash64": "8BE5E9D3CE6E3A38",
      "text": "这座城镇里的餐厅\\n评价很高呢！\\c\\n因为用的几乎都是\\n渍沁镇产的新鲜食材啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "c02_center_29",
      "hash64": "8BEFE6D3CE7689A4",
      "text": "我要趁年轻多多旅行，\\n多多拍照！\\c\\n等我哪天变成了老奶奶，\\n就要看着照片回忆过去。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "c02_center_45",
      "hash64": "8BDBDED3CE65D302",
      "text": "这里有个叫做\\n海岱俱乐部的店很有名啊～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "c02_center_46",
      "hash64": "8BDBDDD3CE65D14F",
      "text": "我想去上面\\n那家三明治店嘛～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "c02_center_50",
      "hash64": "8BD855D3CE62B460",
      "text": "我实在看不懂地图。\\n……北是哪边啊？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "c02_center_51",
      "hash64": "8BD856D3CE62B613",
      "text": "地图App上绿色的方位就是北边哦。\\n如果会迷路，就固定一下地图方位如何？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "c02_center_68",
      "hash64": "8BE25FD3CE6B19E3",
      "text": "玻瓶是配合悬崖建造的城市！\\n所以是一层一层的结构！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "c02_center_98",
      "hash64": "8C00E5D3CE84FB24",
      "text": "哎呀～真是大买特买了一番！\\n接下来要去哪里呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "c02_center_99",
      "hash64": "8C00E6D3CE84FCD7",
      "text": "接下来就去渍沁镇的市场\\n疯狂买买买吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "c02_center_111",
      "hash64": "25F757E7C55B09B2",
      "text": "这里是水都玻瓶～♪\\n说到玻瓶～那就是装水的玻璃瓶～♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "c02_center_118",
      "hash64": "25F760E7C55B18FD",
      "text": "听说在建设升降机之前，\\n人们在城里的上下移动\\r\\n都是靠坐骑宝可梦呢！好辛苦啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "c02_center_127",
      "hash64": "25FAE1E7C55E2A07",
      "text": "听说只有优秀的人才会拥有\\n能让宝可梦太晶化的太晶珠呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "c02_center_128",
      "hash64": "25FAD6E7C55E1756",
      "text": "据说宝可梦只有在\\n帕底亚地区才会太晶化。\\r\\n这究竟是为什么呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "c02_center_143",
      "hash64": "25E65DE7C54CA0B1",
      "text": "在那个一般人不能进入的\\n帕底亚巨坑里，\\r\\n会有怎样的宝可梦呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "c02_center_151",
      "hash64": "25E9DFE7C54FB36E",
      "text": "欢迎来到海岱俱乐部！\\n这里是道馆馆主海岱的店哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "c02_center_165",
      "hash64": "25ED63E7C552C991",
      "text": "玻瓶市美丽的街景\\n是很受欢迎的拍照景点呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "c02_center_169",
      "hash64": "25ED5FE7C552C2C5",
      "text": "我们从明年开始也要上学啦！\\n不知道我能不能交到一大堆朋友啊？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "c02_center_170",
      "hash64": "25F0CCE7C555B1D3",
      "text": "我好期待宿舍生活哦！在那里，\\n就算睡前吃点心也不会挨骂的对吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "c02_top_01",
      "hash64": "56607CDC064C158A",
      "text": "整座城镇的色调改成蓝色之后，\\n来这儿的观光客就变多了。\\c\\n听说这是几年前\\n海岱先生提出来的点子哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "c02_top_07",
      "hash64": "566076DC064C0B58",
      "text": "夹饱堡欢迎您一来二去，三～明治♪\\n来一份三明治吧～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "c02_top_22",
      "hash64": "56676BDC06521755",
      "text": "玻瓶道馆的道馆测验\\n非～常非常难呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "c02_top_23",
      "hash64": "56676ADC065215A2",
      "text": "海岱先生就是这座城市的招牌哦！\\n他平时不拘小节又温柔体贴，\\r\\n但在当道馆馆主的时候又会帅到不行呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "c02_top_31",
      "hash64": "5663E4DC064EFC19",
      "text": "虽然在地形起伏激烈的\\n帕底亚是没办法了，\\r\\n但我真想骑着自行车四处旅行啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "c02_top_32",
      "hash64": "5663E1DC064EF700",
      "text": "听说在其他地区有摩托蜥之外的\\n坐骑宝可梦。这是真的吗～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "c02_top_36",
      "hash64": "5663E5DC064EFDCC",
      "text": "这个月我很努力……\\n所以买个高级包包，不过分吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "c02_top_38",
      "hash64": "5663EBDC064F07FE",
      "text": "换个发型也能换个心情！\\n你说呢？这个发型很可爱吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "c02_top_39",
      "hash64": "5663ECDC064F09B1",
      "text": "呃……\\n你是剪了刘海吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
